   Merged DATA dock — the Data panel folded into the bottom of the Online Tabs
   panel as a compact, always-visible action bar. Sits below the scrolling
   table (a flex:none sibling of .tab-container), so the table keeps all the
   vertical room and the dock stays pinned at the bottom. The Upload / Server
   textareas live in collapsed .form-container's, revealed only on toggle.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.data-dock {
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 8px;
  /* Match the 12px horizontal inset of .panel-search / the table so the dock
     content lines up with everything above it; the border-top still spans the
     full panel width. */
  padding: 10px 12px 10px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.data-dock__main {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px 12px;
  padding: 0;
